      "lastModifiedDate": "2026-09-13T22:30:07.764Z",
      "description": "A vulnerability was found in getzep graphiti up to 0.30.2. Affected is an unknown function of the file server/graph_service/main.py of the component REST API. The manipulation results in improper authentication. The attack can be launched remotely. The pull request to fix this issue awaits acceptance.",
      "severity": 7.3,
      "fix_suggestion": "📦 受影响组件：getzep graphiti\n🛠️ 修复建议：\n1. 确认受影响的版本范围（见上方 Affected Products）\n2. 升级到厂商官方发布的最稳定安全版本\n3. 检查官方安全公告获取补丁链接\n4. 如无法立即升级，实施临时缓解措施：\n   - 网络层：WAF 规则 / IPS 签名 / 零信任策略\n   - 主机层：最小化暴露面 / 禁用危险功能 / 输入过滤\n5. 修复后使用 NVD / 厂商 PoC 验证修复有效性",
